# Hexproof keeps an opponent's Sylvan Caryatid from being a target (CR 702.11b), so it cannot be Symbiosis's second target:
# Bot1's Ornithopter and the Caryatid are the only creatures, yet "two target creatures" has only one legal target and Symbiosis is
# not offered. The control is symbiosis-gives-two-target-creatures-plus-two-plus-two-for-your-own-creatures.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Ornithopter
Mountain
Symbiosis
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Forest
Sylvan Caryatid
Forest x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest#1.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest#2.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Sylvan Caryatid.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
! Bot1.Hand.Symbiosis.Cast

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Stack.Count = 0
